      "solution": "Using Kohlrausch's Law:\n$\\Lambda_m^\\circ(\\mathrm{CH_3COOH}) = \\Lambda_m^\\circ(\\mathrm{CH_3COONa}) + \\Lambda_m^\\circ(\\mathrm{HCl}) - \\Lambda_m^\\circ(\\mathrm{NaCl})$\n$= 91.0 + 426.2 - 126.5 = 390.7\\ \\mathrm{S\\ cm^2\\ mol^{-1}}$."
